{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21018","headline":"染丝上春机 · 李贺","name":"染丝上春机","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉罂泣水桐花井，蒨丝沈水如云影。\n美人嬾态燕脂愁，春梭抛掷鸣高楼。\n彩线结茸背复叠，白袷玉郎寄桃叶。\n爲君挑鸾作腰绶，愿君处处宜春酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}